@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@ticketCode = BH-900001%2F2025
@sessionCookie = replace-with-smartcrm_session-cookie-from-login-response

### Login (copy the smartcrm_session cookie into @sessionCookie; do not commit real values)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manager",
  "password": "replace-with-local-bootstrap-password"
}

### Unauthenticated access must be rejected (remove the Cookie header to run this case)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

### Authenticated ticket lookup
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketCode}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Missing ticket returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/BH-900099%2F2025
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Invalid ticket payload returns the documented 422 response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{}

### Technician status transition (actor code is a prototype request field, not authenticated identity)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketCode}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "status": "DANG_XU_LY",
  "changed_by": "KT002"
}
